These are the steps to remove the Store Locator extension from an existing store front application (currently opened project). Follow these instructions carefully and precisely, do NOT deviate from them.

 # Step 1. Prerequisites: First make sure the current project has all the necessary files. If any requirement in the prerequisite is not met, abort the rest of this instruction.
 <Prerequisites>
 - The folder `src/pages/store-locator` exists
 - The file `config/constants` exists
 - The file `src/components/_app/index.jsx` exists
 - The file `src/components/_app/partials/app-header.jsx` exists
 - The file `src/components/_app/partials/app-modals.jsx` exists
 - The file `src/components/header/index.jsx` exists
 - The file `src/config/constants.js` exists
 - The file `src/contexts/index.js` exists
 - The file `src/routes.tsx` exists
 - The file `src/utils/test-utils.js` exists
 </Prerequisites>

# Step 2. Delete exension page code.
<Delete>
Delete the `src/pages/store-locator` folder and all of its subfolders.
</Delete>

# Step 3. Remove code marked by comment markerss.
<Merge>
For each of the following files, go through them one by one and carefully follow the steps outlined below:
        - `config/constants`
        - `src/components/_app/index.jsx`
        - `src/components/_app/partials/app-header.jsx`
        - `src/components/_app/partials/app-modals.jsx`
        - `src/components/header/index.jsx`
        - `src/config/constants.js`
        - `src/contexts/index.js`
        - `src/routes.tsx`
        - `src/utils/test-utils.js`
    1. For each file, find comment line that contains `@sfdc-extension-line SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR`, remove the comment line as well as the line BELOW it. For example, 
    ```
    const a = 'b'
    // @sfdc-extension-line SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR
    const foo = 'bar'
    const b = 'c'
    ```
    Will become
    ```
    const a = 'b'
    const b= 'c'
    ```
    2. For each file, find the pair of comment lines that begin with `@sfdc-extension-block-start SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR` and end with `@sfdc-extension-block-end SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR`, then remove the entire block including the comment lines. For example:
    ```
    const a = 'b'
    // @sfdc-extension-block-start SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR
    const storeLocator = loadable(() => 
        import('../pages/store-locator')
    // @sfdc-extension-block-end SFDC_EXT_STORE_LOCATOR
    const b = 'c'
    ```
    will become
    ```
    const a = 'b'
    const b = 'c'
    ```
</Merge>
